    <item>
      <title>Kubernetes</title>
      <link>https://docs.uitsmijter.io/installation/kubernetes/</link>
      <pubDate>Mon, 01 Jan 0001 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
      <guid>https://docs.uitsmijter.io/installation/kubernetes/</guid>
      <description>&lt;div class=&#34;gdoc-page__anchorwrap&#34;&gt;&#xA;    &lt;h1 id=&#34;install-uitsmijter-on-kubernetes&#34;&gt;&#xA;        Install Uitsmijter on Kubernetes&#xA;        &lt;a data-clipboard-text=&#34;https://docs.uitsmijter.io/installation/kubernetes/#install-uitsmijter-on-kubernetes&#34; class=&#34;gdoc-page__anchor clip flex align-center&#34; title=&#34;Anchor to: Install Uitsmijter on Kubernetes&#34; aria-label=&#34;Anchor to: Install Uitsmijter on Kubernetes&#34; href=&#34;#install-uitsmijter-on-kubernetes&#34;&gt;&#xA;            &lt;svg class=&#34;gdoc-icon gdoc_link&#34;&gt;&lt;use xlink:href=&#34;#gdoc_link&#34;&gt;&lt;/use&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;&#xA;        &lt;/a&gt;&#xA;    &lt;/h1&gt;&#xA;&lt;/div&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;Here are the steps to install Uitsmijter on Kubernetes:&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;div class=&#34;gdoc-page__anchorwrap&#34;&gt;&#xA;    &lt;h2 id=&#34;prepare-the-installation&#34;&gt;&#xA;        Prepare the installation&#xA;        &lt;a data-clipboard-text=&#34;https://docs.uitsmijter.io/installation/kubernetes/#prepare-the-installation&#34; class=&#34;gdoc-page__anchor clip flex align-center&#34; title=&#34;Anchor to: Prepare the installation&#34; aria-label=&#34;Anchor to: Prepare the installation&#34; href=&#34;#prepare-the-installation&#34;&gt;&#xA;            &lt;svg class=&#34;gdoc-icon gdoc_link&#34;&gt;&lt;use xlink:href=&#34;#gdoc_link&#34;&gt;&lt;/use&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;&#xA;        &lt;/a&gt;&#xA;    &lt;/h2&gt;&#xA;&lt;/div&gt;&#xA;&lt;ul&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;Make sure the following requirements are met:&#xA;&lt;ul&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;Kubernetes is up and running.&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;Traefik is up and running.&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;Your cluster can obtain valid certificates for Ingresses, e.g. with cert-manager.&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;/ul&gt;&#xA;&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;Ensure that you have the following authorizations in the Kubernetes cluster:&#xA;&lt;ul&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;Permissions to deploy ClusterRole, ClusterRoleBinding and ServiceAccount.&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;Permissions to deploy CustomResourceDefinition.&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;Permissions to deploy various Kubernetes resources, including Namespace, ConfigMap, Secret, Service, Deployment, StatefulSet, Ingress and HorizontalPodAutoscaler.&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;Permissions to set up Traefik middlewares.&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;Permissions to create, list and edit CustomResources (client and tenant) in your namespaces.&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;/ul&gt;&#xA;&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;Download the file &lt;a&#xA;  class=&#34;gdoc-markdown__link&#34;&#xA;  href=&#34;https://raw.githubusercontent.com/uitsmijter/charts/refs/heads/main/charts/uitsmijter/values.yaml&#34;&#xA;&gt;values.yaml&lt;/a&gt; from the Uitsmijter &lt;a&#xA;  class=&#34;gdoc-markdown__link&#34;&#xA;  href=&#34;https://charts.uitsmijter.io&#34;&#xA;&gt;Helm chart&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a&#xA;  class=&#34;gdoc-markdown__link&#34;&#xA;  href=&#34;https://docs.uitsmijter.io/configuration&#34;&#xA;&gt;Customize&lt;/a&gt; the values in the file &lt;code&gt;values.yaml&lt;/code&gt; to your needs.&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;/ul&gt;&#xA;&lt;div class=&#34;gdoc-page__anchorwrap&#34;&gt;&#xA;    &lt;h2 id=&#34;install-uitsmijter&#34;&gt;&#xA;        Install Uitsmijter&#xA;        &lt;a data-clipboard-text=&#34;https://docs.uitsmijter.io/installation/kubernetes/#install-uitsmijter&#34; class=&#34;gdoc-page__anchor clip flex align-center&#34; title=&#34;Anchor to: Install Uitsmijter&#34; aria-label=&#34;Anchor to: Install Uitsmijter&#34; href=&#34;#install-uitsmijter&#34;&gt;&#xA;            &lt;svg class=&#34;gdoc-icon gdoc_link&#34;&gt;&lt;use xlink:href=&#34;#gdoc_link&#34;&gt;&lt;/use&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;&#xA;        &lt;/a&gt;&#xA;    &lt;/h2&gt;&#xA;&lt;/div&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;Add Uitsmijter Helm repository:&lt;/p&gt;</description>
    </item>
    <item>
      <title>Docker</title>
      <link>https://docs.uitsmijter.io/installation/docker/</link>
      <pubDate>Mon, 01 Jan 0001 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
      <guid>https://docs.uitsmijter.io/installation/docker/</guid>
      <description>&lt;div class=&#34;gdoc-page__anchorwrap&#34;&gt;&#xA;    &lt;h1 id=&#34;installing-uitsmijter-on-docker&#34;&gt;&#xA;        Installing Uitsmijter on Docker&#xA;        &lt;a data-clipboard-text=&#34;https://docs.uitsmijter.io/installation/docker/#installing-uitsmijter-on-docker&#34; class=&#34;gdoc-page__anchor clip flex align-center&#34; title=&#34;Anchor to: Installing Uitsmijter on Docker&#34; aria-label=&#34;Anchor to: Installing Uitsmijter on Docker&#34; href=&#34;#installing-uitsmijter-on-docker&#34;&gt;&#xA;            &lt;svg class=&#34;gdoc-icon gdoc_link&#34;&gt;&lt;use xlink:href=&#34;#gdoc_link&#34;&gt;&lt;/use&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;&#xA;        &lt;/a&gt;&#xA;    &lt;/h1&gt;&#xA;&lt;/div&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;Uitsmijter is designed for a Docker-only environment, too. This mode is for small installations&#xA;that does not require a Kubernetes Cluster.&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;div class=&#34;gdoc-page__anchorwrap&#34;&gt;&#xA;    &lt;h2 id=&#34;prerequisites&#34;&gt;&#xA;        Prerequisites&#xA;        &lt;a data-clipboard-text=&#34;https://docs.uitsmijter.io/installation/docker/#prerequisites&#34; class=&#34;gdoc-page__anchor clip flex align-center&#34; title=&#34;Anchor to: Prerequisites&#34; aria-label=&#34;Anchor to: Prerequisites&#34; href=&#34;#prerequisites&#34;&gt;&#xA;            &lt;svg class=&#34;gdoc-icon gdoc_link&#34;&gt;&lt;use xlink:href=&#34;#gdoc_link&#34;&gt;&lt;/use&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;&#xA;        &lt;/a&gt;&#xA;    &lt;/h2&gt;&#xA;&lt;/div&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;Ensure Docker is installed and running on your system.&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;div class=&#34;gdoc-page__anchorwrap&#34;&gt;&#xA;    &lt;h2 id=&#34;prepare-docker-environment&#34;&gt;&#xA;        Prepare Docker Environment&#xA;        &lt;a data-clipboard-text=&#34;https://docs.uitsmijter.io/installation/docker/#prepare-docker-environment&#34; class=&#34;gdoc-page__anchor clip flex align-center&#34; title=&#34;Anchor to: Prepare Docker Environment&#34; aria-label=&#34;Anchor to: Prepare Docker Environment&#34; href=&#34;#prepare-docker-environment&#34;&gt;&#xA;            &lt;svg class=&#34;gdoc-icon gdoc_link&#34;&gt;&lt;use xlink:href=&#34;#gdoc_link&#34;&gt;&lt;/use&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;&#xA;        &lt;/a&gt;&#xA;    &lt;/h2&gt;&#xA;&lt;/div&gt;&#xA;&lt;ul&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a&#xA;  class=&#34;gdoc-markdown__link&#34;&#xA;  href=&#34;https://github.com/uitsmijter/docker-compose/archive/refs/heads/main.zip&#34;&#xA;&gt;Download Docker Compose Files&lt;/a&gt; from the dedicated repository.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
    </item>
